"Version" is a released state of the Software, identified by its release tag.

"Release Date" of a Version is the date that Version was first made available by the Licensor.

"Change Date" of a Version is two years after its Release Date.

"Change License" is the Apache License, Version 2.0.

"Competing Use" is making the Software, or a work derived from it, available to a third party
as a product or service whose primary function is substantially the same as a product or
